{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Its sides.</b> Here it is a term of corners, as its Targum renders — because it says עַל שְׁנֵי צִדָּיו — on the two corners that are on its two sides." "<b>And it shall be.</b> The making of these rings." "<b>For houses, for rings.</b> The ring is to be a housing by itself."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:41.461902230Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}